Z||000007||mgbringo||04-28-2001||09:18 PM||||It was really nice to meet you finally Ross.  I am looking forward to seeing your car soon.  Would be nice to get pictures of our cars together with your license plates being FIEROGT and mine GTFIERO.<P>Mine was pretty dirty when you took the pictures.  We were recovering from the flood with lots of sand bags in the yard.<P>We could also do a mini meet at our lake, Big Cormorant, about 45 miles East of Fargo.  <P>------------------<BR>1986 Fiero GT||||reg||1
Z||000008||JSocha||04-29-2001||11:21 PM||||RossT and V8Fiero,<P>Nice seeing you this weekend!  We should all consider that get together in SD!<P><B>RossT:</B>  Pictures really turned out sharp.  Thanks for the hospitality and taking me to see your friends Lambo kit.  Doug and I really enjoyed it.<P><B>V8Fiero:</B>  Hope you get your heating problem figured out.  Was nice finally meeting you.  If you get your vehicle done, lets consider the Devils Run at Devils Lake this summer.  Of course, if you don't make headway, there is always next year.<P>Anyone else interested in Devils Run in Devils Lake, ND this summer?  Big, big, big car show every year!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jnjsochasig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
